SUMMARY:🌷 International Women’s Day: Mimosa or tulips
DESCRIPTION:In Italy a sprig of mimosa has been given since 1946\; in Russi
 a and Eastern Europe tulips are typical. In Spain and Latin America 8M is 
 above all a day of protest: if you give flowers\, make them a recognition\
 , not a substitute for listening. Where: Italy\, Russia and Eastern Europe
 . Guide: https://www.calendariodeflores.com/en/womens-day/
